skills will require engaging in school activities or after-school clubs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTER AND CLOTHES CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can start to play as either girl or boy, with a range of parameters to customize, and 20+ equipment slots for clothes and accessories. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVAL SIMULATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your character has health, hunger, thirst, energy, and comfort stats. During the game, you'll have to balance limited resources and take care of your character's needs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TIME OF YEAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game world is dynamic and will change according to 24 hour day cycle and current time of year. Some events and opportunities will be available only during specific time.</p>",
